    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishoi e Ruben",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.35.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 35.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.49.3+GEN.49.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "49.3-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kulo ile ishoi e Ruben ilo kikau le Israel, (ore enkaraki natijing'a enkaji e papaai lenye, meekure eikenari aajo olkikau. Ore erishata enye neishori ilayiok le Yosef olayioni le Israel. Amu eitu eigeri enkarna enye te mbuku oo iishoritin anaa olkikau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.49.8+GEN.49.9+GEN.49.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 49.8-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore hoo naa Yuda apa ogol alang ilalashera lenyena, naa ninye eimu ilo kitok, kake ene Yosef enjung'ore o lkikau.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilayiok le Ruben ilo kikau le Israel naa: Hanok, o Palu, o Hesron, o Karmi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo ilayiok le Yoel: Shemia olayioni lenye, o Gog olayioni lenye, o Shimei olayioni lenye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Mika olayioni lenye, o Reaia olayioni lenye, o Baal olayioni lenye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.15.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ilai 15.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " o Beara olayioni lenye, laa ninye apa eewa olaiguanani Tilgat Pilnesa le Asiria te yararoto. Ninye apa oltung'ani kitok too le Ruben. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore iltung'ana lenye too lmareita lenye, ina kata pee eigeri iiishoritin enye naa: ore olkitok lenye naa Yerel, o Sakaria, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Bela olayioni le Asas, olayioni le Shema, olayioni le Yoel, apa omanya Aroer ometabaiki Nebo o Baalmeon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etobiko sii apa te nkalo o loo saen ometabaiki olpolosie lo lpurkel tena shoto e Frati, amu etoponari apa nkishu enye te nkop e Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too nkolong'i e Saul neitayunye iltung'ana le Hagrit olarrabal, neibung ninche, nebik ninche too lng'oborri lenye te nkop pooki e Gilead te nkalo oloosaen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishoi e Gad",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etamanya apa ilayiok le Gad aatashare ninche te nkop e Bashan ometabaiki Saleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoel apa olkitok nesujaki Shafan o Yanai o Shafat te Bashan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore olorere lenye te risioroto oo nkajijik oo loo menye naa: Mikael, o Meshulam, o Sheba, o Yorai, o Yakan, o Sia, o Eber, lelo pokira oopishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo apa ilayiok le Abihail olayioni le Huri olayioni le Yaroa, olayioni le Gilead, olayioni le Mikael, olayioni le Yeshishai, olayioni le Yohado, olayioni le Buus; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahis olayioni le Abdiel, olayioni le Guni ninye apa olkitok te nkaji e menye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nebik apa ninye te Gilead, tiatua Bashan o too nkang'itie enyena, o teina kop pooki nairritishoreki e Sharon o meiting'ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eigeroki apa kuna baa pooki anaa iishoritin too nkolong'i e Yotam olaiguanani le Yuda o too nkolong'i e Yeroboam olaiguanani le Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Njorin oo loshon le nkalo oloosaen",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tiatua iloshon le Ruben ore Gad o lpisiaai lo losho le Manase, neeta iltung'ana magil, oata long'oi o lalema, neeta nkai, naa arriyiak to larrabal, naa nkalifuni artam oong'uan, o iip naapishana o ntomoni ile, neterretenate ninche te nkisiaayiare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitayu ninche olarrabal o Lhagri, olyetur, Olmafish, Olnadab; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore ake pee eng'amu ninche eretoto pee egilunore ninche, ore Ilhagri, o lelo pooki ootii tenebo ninche neishoori aapik nkaik oo le Ruben, amu Olaitoriani eishirakitia ninche to larrabal, neisho ninche Enkai eomonunoto enye enkaraki naisiliga ninche ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neya ninche nkishu enye, o ntamesin enye nkalifuni onom, o nkerra nkalifuni iip are o onom, o sirkon nkalifuni are, o ltung'ana ooishu nkalifuni iip nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eirragaitie ilkumok etuata, amu ore ilo arrabal naa ole Nkai. Nebik ninche te nkop enye ometabau eyararoto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iltung'ana le nkalo oloo saen le Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore olpisiai loo ltung'ana le Manase nebik teina kop, neaku ninche kumok oleng te Bashan o metabaiki Baarhermon, o Senir, o ldoinyio le Hermon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo apa ilukuny oo nkajijik oo loo menye: Efer, o Ishi, o Eliel, o Esriel, o Yeremia, o Hadafia, o Yadiel, lelo murran magil, ooning'o, laa lukuny oo nkajijik oo loo menye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etaarayioki aaipang'ie iloshon lo loosaen",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
